{"id":84,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Its short wings make flying difficult. Instead, this Pokémon runs at high speed on developed legs."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Doduo’s two heads contain completely identical brains. A scientific study reported that on rare occasions, there will be examples of this Pokémon possessing different sets of brains."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Doduo’s two heads never sleep at the same time. Its two heads take turns sleeping, so one head can always keep watch for enemies while the other one sleeps."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"A two-headed Pokémon that was discovered as a sudden mutation. It runs at a pace of over 60 miles per hour."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It races through grassy plains with powerful strides, leaving footprints up to four inches deep."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"By alternately raising and lowering its two heads, it balances itself to be more stable while running."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"A bird that makes up for its poor flying with its fast foot speed. Leaves giant footprints."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Even while eating or sleeping, one of the heads remains always vigilant for any sign of danger. When threatened, it flees at over 60 miles per hour."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It lives on a grassy plain where it can see a long way. If it sees an enemy, it runs away at 60 mph."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Run Away","hidden":false,"description":"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon."},{"name":"Early Bird","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon awakens from sleep twice as fast as other Pokémon."},{"name":"Tangled Feet","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness if it is confused."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"grassland","color":"Brown","shape":"Legs","evolution":{"id":84,"name":"Doduo","condition":null,"children":[{"id":85,"name":"Dodrio","condition":"Lv. 31","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,45],[1,64],[5,98],[9,31],[14,365],[19,458],[23,97],[27,253],[30,367],[33,14],[36,65],[39,283],[43,37]],"machine":[512,332,97,226,34,413,38,283,203,263,297,270,282,67,679,189,182,240,156,214,164,241,129,14,366,36,851,168,675,253],"egg":[372,175,143,18],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv4pt5-199","name":"Doduo","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Shiny Rare","number":"199","artist":"Saya Tsuruta","img":"sv4pt5/199"},{"id":"sv3pt5-84","name":"Doduo","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Common","number":"84","artist":"Anesaki Dynamic","img":"sv3pt5/84"},{"id":"sm10-150","name":"Doduo","set":"Unbroken Bonds","date":"2019-05-03","rarity":"Common","number":"150","artist":"kodama","img":"sm10/150"},{"id":"xy12-69","name":"Doduo","set":"Evolutions","date":"2016-11-02","rarity":"Common","number":"69","artist":"Mitsuhiro Arita","img":"xy12/69"},{"id":"xy12-112","name":"Imakuni?'s Doduo","set":"Evolutions","date":"2016-11-02","rarity":"Rare Secret","number":"112","artist":"Imakuni?","img":"xy12/112"},{"id":"g1-55","name":"Doduo","set":"Generations","date":"2016-02-22","rarity":"Common","number":"55","artist":"Eri Yamaki","img":"g1/55"},{"id":"xy8-115","name":"Doduo","set":"BREAKthrough","date":"2015-11-04","rarity":"Common","number":"115","artist":"Naoki Saito","img":"xy8/115"},{"id":"xy8-116","name":"Doduo","set":"BREAKthrough","date":"2015-11-04","rarity":"Common","number":"116","artist":"Naoki Saito","img":"xy8/116"},{"id":"xy1-98","name":"Doduo","set":"XY","date":"2014-02-05","rarity":"Common","number":"98","artist":"Sumiyoshi Kizuki","img":"xy1/98"},{"id":"bw8-99","name":"Doduo","set":"Plasma Storm","date":"2013-02-06","rarit